  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You have created a simple formula allowing you to revitalize your allies. Once per encounter, as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a>, you can allow an adjacent non-Droid creature to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Catch_a_Second_Wind\" title=\"Catch a Second Wind\">Catch a Second Wind</a>.<br><br>This Second Wind is not counted towards target's normal daily ability to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Catch_a_Second_Wind\" title=\"Catch a Second Wind\">Catch a Second Wind</a>, but if both are used in the same encounter the target moves -1 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persistent\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Persistent\">Persistent</a> step down the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a> at the end of the encounter. The penalties imposed by this <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persistent_Condition\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Persistent Condition\">Persistent Condition</a> persist until the target takes at least 8 hours to recuperate, during which time the target can't engage in any strenuous activity.",
